The sanitized reconstruction deliberately excludes the credential-bearing
canonical descendant `e7002d4dacde0ae4c6b92db454fa4034c830e8f4`. The paths
`incoming_review/openai-api-key.txt` and
`incoming_review/openai-api-key (1).txt` are absent. Their contents were not
